1 : install tools : 
    - install mongoDB
    - install nodeJs LTS
    - install angular
2 : 
    2.1: run PMA
        2.1.1 : run frontend
            - cd /PMA/PMA-Frontend:
            - run npm install
            - run ng s (to run the server)
        2.1.2 : run backend
            - cd /PMA/PMA-Backend:
            - fill .env file with db connection and port
            - run npm install
            - run npm start (to run the server)
    2.2: run PTE
        2.1.1 : run frontend
            - cd /PTE/PTE_Frontend:
            - run npm install
            - run ng s --port=4201 (to run the server on port 4201)
        2.1.2 : run backend
            - cd /PTE/PTE_Backend:
            - fill .env file with db connection and port
            - run npm install
            - run npm start (to run the server)
    2.3: run OPM
        2.3.1 : run frontend
            - cd /OPM/frontend:
            - run npm install
            - run ng s --port=4202 (to run the server on port 4202)
        2.3.2 : run backend
            - cd /OPM/backend:
            - fill .env file with db connection and port
            - run npm install
            - run npm start (to run the server)
    
